  {
    "shortcode": "DKg9McEseAd",
    "caption": "Freediving is all fun and games until you hit Canada’s Pacific Northwest, then it gets real, fast. The water’s colder, darker, and heavier. Visibility can vanish overnight, and the thermoclines hit like walls. You’re not just diving anymore, you’re negotiating with nature.\n⠀\nOut there, the ocean isn’t forgiving. You’re dealing with icy temps, strong currents, and unpredictable swells. Your gear matters, your mindset matters more, and every dive demands respect. It’s raw, wild, and humbling, and that’s exactly why it’s worth it.\n⠀\n🧜🏻‍♂️ @luca.freediver \n⠀\n#alchemy #alchemyfins #freediving #alchemyv3 #underwaterphotography #freedive #carbon #carbonfins #bifins #diving #ocean #nature #fitness #explore #freedivingphotos #watersports #discover #adventure #saltlife #apnea #freediver #freediverlife #freedivingfins",
